167
00:16:14,433 --> 00:16:15,893
- It was a half-cheat.
- Which is?

168
00:16:15,977 --> 00:16:17,979
The other side of a half-truth.

169
00:16:18,062 --> 00:16:19,939
- The facts are murky.
- Murky.

170
00:16:20,022 --> 00:16:21,816
I hate to break this to you, pal,

171
00:16:21,899 --> 00:16:25,528
